[[File:Lustrous_Russet_Armor.png|thumb|[[Half Elf]] in a Lustrous Russet set.|left]]

A planar armor set for chain and plate wearing classes; similar to how Midnight Armor is for cloth and leather classes. It drops as part of [[Classic Planar Armor: Group 1|Group 1 Armor Sets]] in the [[Plane of Fear]] and [[Plane of Hate]]. Additionally, this armor set can be farmed by hunting [[A Haunted Chest|haunted chests]] in non-raid instances of [[Plane of Hate]].

